Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3 (>= 3.10), python3-pyqt6, python3-opencv, python3-numpy, python3-pil, python3-pyzbar, v4l-utils, ffmpeg, libxcb-cursor0, libzbar0, opencv-data
Description: webcam application for photo capture and recording
 MintCam turns a webcam into a live preview, photo capture and video
 recording tool. It also handles QR scanning, focus assist, face auto
 framing, time-lapse, motion detection, background blur and RTMP
 streaming.
 .
 The Python dependencies are installed on first start into a per user
 virtualenv; see README.source for why this is done that way.
